# M9 "İlk Kan": an Aydor warrior hunts Kül Çömezi until level 2 (80 experience: three or four kills;
# `scene hunt` targets the nearest one without a neighbour (one at a time), auto-attacks, uses Ağır
# Darbe when ready and rests sitting on the ground - server-driven stance, doubled regeneration -
# below 75 % hp; after an unlucky death it respawns and hunts on). The level-up shows "Seviye 2!", a
# golden ring and glow, refilled bars and the new level in the HUD.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m9_levelup
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Yukselen
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+monsters 1800
expect world+level1
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene hunt Kül Çömezi 2
waitfor world+kills1 3000
# Resting between two fights: sitting on the ground.
waitfor world+seated+serversitting 3000
scene camera front 18 4.5
wait 20
screenshot 01_resting.png
scene camera behind 22 7
waitfor world+levelups1 9000
wait 25
screenshot 02_level_up.png
expect world+levelupfx+level2
scene expectlevel 2
scene expecthp 100 100
scene combatlog
quit
